cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this work, please cite the manuscript and this reproducibility release."
title: "Parity-Odd Weak Lensing from Chiral Vector Dark Matter: Reproducibility Repository"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Deonarine
    given-names: Brandon
    affiliation: "The University of the West Indies, St. Augustine"
version: 1.1.0
date-released: 2026-08-26
repository-code: "https://github.com/M3RCU3Y/chiral-vector-lensing"
abstract: >-
  Analytic derivations and reproducible numerical pilots connecting chiral
  massive-vector production to helical momentum currents, frame dragging and
  parity-odd weak lensing, including strict de-aliasing, independent Proca
  constraint diagnostics, spatial/timestep/seed convergence controls and a
  capture dynamic-range theorem.
keywords:
  - dark photon
  - axion
  - Proca field
  - weak lensing
  - parity violation
  - frame dragging
  - helicity
